OL,3,GNEWSACake shed owner vows to carry on
OL,4,Aafter theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of an honesty-box cake shed
OL,7,Fin Capel-le-Ferne has said she will
OL,8,Fcontinue running the business after
OL,9,Fcakes were stolen by a group of youths.
OL,11,FEmma Burton, who runs the Capel Cake
OL,12,FShed, said support from customers had
OL,13,Fconvinced her not to give up after
OL,14,Ffootage of the theft was shared online
OL,15,Fand viewed millions of times.
OL,17,FThe incident was reported to Kent
OL,18,FPolice on 16 August after cakes were
OL,19,Fstolen earlier that day.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
